  <h2 class="sec-title">Your data, versioned<br>and traceable. <span class="dl-version">In development</span></h2>
  <p class="sec-sub">Store, organize, version and share your own biological datasets inside OmniBioAI. Every dataset gets checksums, immutable versions, lineage back to the workflows that produced it, and a GA4GH DRS identifier pipelines can use directly.</p>
