    <li class="repo-item">Upload, or register existing data in place without copying</li>
    <li class="repo-item">Versioning with checksums and full provenance</li>
    <li class="repo-item">Organization- and project-level access control</li>
    <li class="repo-item">GA4GH DRS API for workflow and tool interoperability</li>
  </ul>
